    },
    "coldCache": "Fresh native artifact cache or exact tested Docker images evicted. Both variants fetched from the same local HTTP mirror / Docker registry. Measures transfer + extraction + initialization without public Internet variability. OS page cache is not flushed.",
    "notes": [
      "Hot: 3 measured fresh databases after one warmup; all enabled images/artifacts cached.",
      "Cold: 1 fresh-cache sample per cell; exploratory and not a statistical performance guarantee.",
      "RSS/PSS: median of snapshots at 30/35/40 seconds after readiness and background preparation completion, then median across hot starts.",
      "Retained restart: stop/start after each hot memory sample, preserving database data.",
      "Both variants run sequentially on shared physical hardware. No cross-platform speed claims.",
      "Local native archives repacked with zstd -19. Docker variants preserve base environment and change PostgreSQL/Realtime startup scripts plus one Pooler BEAM module compiled from its exact pinned source. These are experimental artifacts, not a full Nix rebuild or published release.",
      "Docker cold runs evict exact tested image references; shared layers referenced by unrelated images and OS page cache may remain. This is application-cache cold, not a cold engine or machine boot.",
      "The same approximately 100 ms public status monitor runs during both variants; its observation overhead is included.",
      "Optimized Linux archives use GNU tar format without macOS xattrs/ACLs/file flags; an initial warmup with accidental macOS metadata was stopped and excluded before measured Linux samples."
    ]
  },
